of 101.41% from the latest price.",analystTarget:{target:"$11.46",change:"101.41%",changeWord:"upside"},analystChart:{strongBuy:5,buy:1,hold:2,sell:2,strongSell:0},news:{exp:"1786422442282",data:[{url:"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/08/10/3341609/0/en/eh216-s-completes-central-asia-s-first-pilotless-human-carrying-evtol-flight-in-the-heart-of-kazakhstan-s-capital.html",img:"https://cdn.snapi.dev/images/v1/d/k/g/press5-3859438.jpg",title:"EH216-S Completes Central Asia's First Pilotless Human-Carrying eVTOL Flight in the Heart of Kazakhstan's Capital",text:"ASTANA, Kazakhstan, Aug. 10, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- EHang Holdings Limited (Nasdaq: EH) (“EHang” or the “Company”), a world-leading advanced air mobility (“AAM”) technology platform company, today a...",source:"GlobeNewsWire",type:"Article",tickers:void 0,time:"Aug 10, 2026, 5:32 AM EDT",ago:"18 hours ago"},{url:"https://www.tipranks.com/news/the-fly/ehang-downgraded-to-neutral-from-buy-at-goldman-sachs-thefly-news",img:"https://blog.tipranks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Industrials-1-750x406.jpg",title:"EHang downgraded to Neutral from Buy at Goldman Sachs",text:"Goldman Sachs downgraded EHang (EH) to Neutral from Buy with a price target of $7.30, down from $16.90.",source:"TheFly",type:"Article",tickers:void 0,time:"2026-07-14T10:20:33.000Z",ago:"27 days ago"},{url:"https://www.tipranks.com/news/the-fly/ehang-downgraded-to-neutral-at-goldman-sachs-on-valuation-thefly-news",img:"https://blog.tipranks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Industrials-8-750x406.jpg",title:"EHang downgraded to Neutral at Goldman Sachs on valuation",text:"As previously reported, Goldman Sachs downgraded EHang (EH) to Neutral from Buy with a price target of $7.30, down from $16.90, citing what the firm views as a “fair valuation.”…",source:"TheFly",type:"Article",tickers:void 0,time:"2026-07-14T10:20:16.000Z",ago:"27 days ago"},{url:"https://www.tipranks.com/news/the-fly/ehang-price-target-lowered-to-7-70-from-26-at-morg