ks ago"},{url:"https://www.tipranks.com/news/the-fly/ehang-price-target-lowered-to-13-from-16-at-bofa-thefly-news",img:"https://blog.tipranks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Industrials-2-750x406.jpg",title:"EHang price target lowered to $13 from $16 at BofA",text:"BofA lowered the firm’s price target on EHang (EH) to $13 from $16 and keeps a Buy rating on the shares. The company reported a Q1 miss on lower sales…",source:"TheFly",type:"Article",tickers:void 0,time:"2026-06-09T16:50:09.000Z",ago:"2 months ago"},{url:"/stocks/eh/transcripts/595978-q1-2026/",img:"",title:"EHang Holdings Earnings Call Transcript: Q1 2026",text:"Revenue for Q1 2026 was RMB 25.7 million, with gross margin stable at 62.5%. Human-carrying eVTOLs and non-human-carrying businesses are expected to contribute 60% and 40% of revenue, respectively, with overseas markets and new products driving future growth.",source:"Transcripts",type:"Article",tickers:void 0,time:"Jun 9, 2026, 8:00 AM EDT",ago:"2 months ago"},{url:"/stocks/eh/filings/3089887/",img:"",title:"EHang Holdings Earnings release: Q1 2026",text:"EHang Holdings released its Q1 2026 earnings on June 9, 2026, summarizing the period's financial results.",source:"Filings",type:"Article",tickers:void 0,time:"Jun 9, 2026, 8:00 AM EDT",ago:"2 months ago"},{url:"/stocks/eh/filings/3091378/",img:"",title:"EHang Holdings Slides: Q1 2026",text:"EHang Holdings has posted slides in relation to its Q1 2026 quarterly earnings report, which was published on June 9, 2026.",source:"Filings",type:"Article",tickers:void 0,time:"Jun 9, 2026, 8:00 AM EDT",ago:"2 months ago"},{url:"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/06/09/3308569/0/en/EHang-Reports-First-Quarter-2026-Unaudited-Financial-Results.html",img:"https://cdn.snapi.dev/images/v1/d/w/y/press8-3743279.jpg",title:"EHang Reports First Quarter 2026 Unaudited Financial Results",text:"GUANGZHOU, China, June 09, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- EHang Holdings Limited (Nasdaq: EH) (“EHang” or the “Company